  "details": "It does seem like VRChat wants to keep it where the Age Requirement to play the game stays 13+. So with that in mind I wanted to think of ways that VRChat can keep Adult Content ONLY AVALIABLE to Adults. Because no matter how much we argue about it there will always be kids on this game, and the easily accessibility to NSFW content is simply just not okay. I think one of the GENIUENLY EASIEST ways to separate it, for avatars at least (SPS Etc+), is to add a new Built-In Parameter to Avatars. This way you can lock NSFW content on your Avatar behind it without restricting the use of the Avatar itself.",
